[2026-03-14T20:39:51.506Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01V46PBhQHbuDiZzfheapA2X","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Google Flights Clone — Test Specification\n     2→\n     3→## Page: Search Page (Home)\n     4→\n     5→### Components\n     6→- TripTypeSelector\n     7→- PassengerCountSelector\n     8→- CabinClassSelector\n     9→- AirportAutocomplete\n    10→- DatePicker\n    11→- SearchButton\n    12→- RecentSearches\n    13→- PopularDestinations\n    14→\n    15→### TripTypeSelector\n    16→\n    17→#### Test: TripTypeSelector displays default \"Round trip\" selection\n    18→- **Components**: TripTypeSelector\n    19→- **Initial state**: Search page loads with default settings\n    20→- **Action**: User observes the trip type selector\n    21→- **Expected**: The selector displays \"Round trip\" as the default selected option. It is rendered as a custom dropdown (not a native select element).\n    22→\n    23→#### Test: TripTypeSelector opens dropdown and shows all options\n    24→- **Components**: TripTypeSelector\n    25→- **Initial state**: Search page loaded, trip type selector is closed\n    26→- **Action**: User clicks the trip type selector\n    27→- **Expected**: A dropdown menu opens showing three options: \"Round trip\", \"One way\", and \"Multi-city\". Each option is clickable.\n    28→\n    29→#### Test: TripTypeSelector selects \"One way\" and hides return date\n    30→- **Components**: TripTypeSelector, DatePicker\n    31→- **Initial state**: Search page loaded with \"Round trip\" selected, return date picker is visible\n    32→- **Action**: User clicks the trip type selector and selects \"One way\"\n    33→- **Expected**: The selector updates to show \"One way\". The return date picker is hidden. The dropdown closes.\n    34→\n    35→#### Test: TripTypeSelector selects \"Multi-city\" option\n    36→- **Components**: TripTypeSelector\n    37→- **Initial state**: Search page loaded with \"Round trip\" selected\n    38→- **Action**: User clicks the trip type selector and selects \"Multi-city\"\n    39→- **Expected**: The selector updates to show \"Multi-city\". The search form adjusts to support multi-city input (multiple origin/destination pairs).\n    40→\n    41→#### Test: TripTypeSelector switches back to \"Round trip\" from \"One way\"\n    42→- **Components**: TripTypeSelector, DatePicker\n    43→- **Initial state**: \"One way\" is currently selected, return date picker is hidden\n    44→- **Action**: User clicks the trip type selector and selects \"Round trip\"\n    45→- **Expected**: The selector updates to show \"Round trip\". The return date picker becomes visible again.\n    46→\n    47→#### Test: TripTypeSelector closes dropdown when clicking outside\n    48→- **Components**: TripTypeSelector\n    49→- **Initial state**: Trip type dropdown is open\n    50→- **Action**: User clicks outside the dropdown"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"caed05c8-a48c-4a20-945a-0c006d1f37c2","uuid":"e8852367-f080-4357-84f2-0ae6434f7424","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/docs/tests.md","content":"# Google Flights Clone — Test Specification\n\n## Page: Search Page (Home)\n\n### Components\n- TripTypeSelector\n- PassengerCountSelector\n- CabinClassSelector\n- AirportAutocomplete\n- DatePicker\n- SearchButton\n- RecentSearches\n- PopularDestinations\n\n### TripTypeSelector\n\n#### Test: TripTypeSelector displays default \"Round trip\" selection\n- **Components**: TripTypeSelector\n- **Initial state**: Search page loads with default settings\n- **Action**: User observes the trip type selector\n- **Expected**: The selector displays \"Round trip\" as the default selected option. It is rendered as a custom dropdown (not a native select element).\n\n#### Test: TripTypeSelector opens dropdown and shows all options\n- **Components**: TripTypeSelector\n- **Initial state**: Search page loaded, trip type selector is closed\n- **Action**: User clicks the trip type selector\n- **Expected**: A dropdown menu opens showing three options: \"Round trip\", \"One way\", and \"Multi-city\". Each option is clickable.\n\n#### Test: TripTypeSelector selects \"One way\" and hides return date\n- **Components**: TripTypeSelector, DatePicker\n- **Initial state**: Search page loaded with \"Round trip\" selected, return date picker is visible\n- **Action**: User clicks the trip type selector and selects \"One way\"\n- **Expected**: The selector updates to show \"One way\". The return date picker is hidden. The dropdown closes.\n\n#### Test: TripTypeSelector selects \"Multi-city\" option\n- **Components**: TripTypeSelector\n- **Initial state**: Search page loaded with \"Round trip\" selected\n- **Action**: User clicks the trip type selector and selects \"Multi-city\"\n- **Expected**: The selector updates to show \"Multi-city\". The search form adjusts to support multi-city input (multiple origin/destination pairs).\n\n#### Test: TripTypeSelector switches back to \"Round trip\" from \"One way\"\n- **Components**: TripTypeSelector, DatePicker\n- **Initial state**: \"One way\" is currently selected, return date picker is hidden\n- **Action**: User clicks the trip type selector and selects \"Round trip\"\n- **Expected**: The selector updates to show \"Round trip\". The return date picker becomes visible again.\n\n#### Test: TripTypeSelector closes dropdown when clicking outside\n- **Components**: TripTypeSelector\n- **Initial state**: Trip type dropdown is open\n- **Action**: User clicks outside the dropdown","numLines":50,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1414}}}
